        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s3"
      },
      "text": "The group uses an advanced piece of malware known as Remsec (Backdoor.Remsec) to conduct its attacks.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
